what up space fam golden here from anime  uproar and i'm back at it again to  discuss the latest and craziest  developments in the one piece story and  wow  what an amazing chapter we got here we  got kaido being shocked at luffy's  evolved devil fruit what looks like the  end of the luffy versus kaido battle  after so many chapters and much more so  make sure to stay tuned for this one if  you do enjoy these one-piece reviews and  want to keep them coming you know what  to do chill a pirate king within and  smash that like button with no mercy  always remember smashing his pirate king  energy and passing is scared orochi  energy so choose wisely if you haven't  make this the video subscribe and hit  that notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece videos and updates and while  you wait for the next chapter to drop  feel free to check out my huge and  growing one piece playlist that includes  videos on all the yonko admirals  supernova and much more link to that is  in the description and now without  further ado let's jump into it spoilers  and all this chapter is called winners  shouldn't need rationalizations which  implies this is already going to be a  pretty hyped chapter and we'll get more  into its significance when we get to  that part of the chapter we start off  strong with drake actually managing to  sneak up on the cp zero agent the  chapter starts with him already having  stabbed him oda toys with us a bit  suggesting that this might be it for the  agent he asks drake why as people tend  to do when it's over for them drake says  he is enacting his own justice and he  deserves respect for that my favorite  characters have their own sense of  justice like luffy and don't blindly  follow orders from the world government  the agent says that i quote i envy you  to drake and i personally feel like this  will be relevant as we learn more about  this dude he wants to be able to follow  his own justice or to just have his own  justice in the first place like drake  but clearly something is preventing him  which will no doubt be revealed as we  gather more info about him and his  backstory either way we have a turning  of the table situation being stabbed  with a sword doesn't saw our cp-0 agent  down in the least and he not only  escapes in a flash he delivers another  blow to drake which seems to be the  finishing one drake probably won't get  up again during this war but it was  necessary for him to do something here  drake going down without doing at least  this much would have been kind of sad  however how much this attack actually  slows down the cp-0 agent remains to be  seen clearly for the time being he's  still fast and deadly after this we got  the stark contrast of the battlefield  being juxtaposed to the celebration  below people are in a good mood and  making wishes using sky lanterns  including toko we know our guys are  fighting for all these people so once  more it shows us what's on the line we  then jump to the main event the fight  against luffy and kaido and wow kaido  can definitely take a punch or should i  say a million punches he just keeps  getting punched from all directions it's  hard to predict with luffy's countless  hydro punches where the next fist will  strike and even while kaido blocks one  he gets hit by another although luffy is  out of breath kaido does say the punch  is hurt with an exclamation mark which  is always high praise coming from ayanko  and the strongest creature he also says  something huge which has been touched  upon throughout the arc he says rubber  shouldn't be able to do this if this was  a one time thing we could say oda was  making fun of himself a bit for how much  creative license he's taken with the  rubber fruit but when we think about  everything else we learned throughout  the arc like about joy boy and the  importance of luffy's fruit it seems  clear this is yet another hype statement  telling us that luffy's fruit is special  not to mention luffy was special enough  to evolve or awaken it to this point and  such a statement also prepares us for  future power-ups which as kaido says may  move more and more beyond what rubber  should be able to do such comments  invite us to think of the legendary  fruit that hasn't awakened for centuries  that the five elders were discussing the  only one that was special enough for the  government to give it a unique name so  that they could hide the fruit's true  name from history in its initial forms  it may look like rubber but as it  awakens as mentioned it's bound to look  less and less like it after all these  clues i would be very surprised at this  point if this fruit in question didn't  turn out to be luffy's own so back to  the fight and luffy's more and more  awakening powers that even make a yonko  question them as if to quickly move on  from the huge statement kaido enters his  flirty drunk phase and tells luffy to  stop at you with a heart you know you're  a boss when you can be flirty against an  opponent who is trying their hardest to  finish you off again whatever happens  they made kaido very impressive during  this fight yeah luffy is getting  stronger and stronger and landing a  countless number of attacks but kaido is  fine and doing well drunk kaido talks  about how luffy is not the only one that  can see the future and then says he'll  take a page from luffy's book he starts  moving his body like luffy's punches the  dude is really showing off and again  doesn't seem phased by the onslaught of  attacks luffy launched kaido in dragon  form even bites and then quote unquote  eats luffy before spinning him out and  immediately launching a point-blank last  breath luffy enters bound man to deal  with the attack and bounce back to the  fighting field once more luffy  emphasized that his time is running out  he doesn't even know how many minutes  left he's got and says he doesn't have  time to waste kaido pours salt on the  wound saying luffy is in worse shape  than kairo even thought it is already  not looking well luffy says he can't  lose here everyone in wano will continue  to starve and go thirsty if kaido sticks  around kaido laughs at luffy for joining  forces with the people of wano who are  used to defeat he says they are either  weak pacifists or content to die for the  sake of honor another reference to the  samurai being too ready to die instead  of finding a way to keep living and keep  fighting luffy says shut up getting  pretty defensive and says the samurai  are strong and of course it depends on  your definition of strength for kaido a  brave face aka being stoic in the face  of adversity doesn't make people strong  he says winners shouldn't need  rationalizations which are you a winner  or a loser and that actually reminds me  of a high q episode i watched yesterday  where a player was trying to find a  reason to get excited about the idea of  winning in volleyball and another  character said who needs a reason to  want to win or to not want to lose for  kaido luffy's statement of he can't lose  for the sake of the people of wano is  unnecessary for kaido he just wants to  win to win and you can talk all about  honor he says and rationalize why the  samurai is supposedly strong but if they  can't win the fight then they're still  losers in his eyes although how much he  truly believes in this cut and drive  philosophy will soon be questioned for  now luffy launches supreme kong gun and  it's another satisfying panel showing  what looks like kaido taking a lot of  damage luffy goes in to attack again but  is surprised to see kaido has recovered  quickly and launches an attack of his  own sending luffy to the ground whited  out eyes and everything he starts the  exhaling process but then covers his  mouth thinking he can't let any escape  or he'll lose power so luffy is at the  edge barely still going and kaido is  fine and smiling as he enters his  homicidal drunk phase for this reason it  seems like luffy needs another gear or  form he needs to get the awakening that  was hinted at last chapter with that  crazy cool silhouette the hope is when  he expends all he's got he'll be able to  tap into something deeper and bounce  back again but we'll see one thing's  clear even if he keeps going like this  which it doesn't even appear like he can  it still hasn't been enough to slow  kaido down or to even wipe the smile  from his face and so i can't see this  version of luffy finishing things off  for now luffy says one more shot if this  isn't enough i'll lose again reiterating  how bad luffy's situation appears but  it's hype too because it seems like  it'll end with both fighters using as  much energy and power they can muster in  one hit but then just as we're expecting  that insane epic clash the cp-0 agent  interrupts luffy's attack meaning that  kaido just went full out on a helpless  luffy and it was point-blank range even  though kaido was saying it's all about  winners and losers before it's clear  that he's upset cp 0 interfered he  recalls when odin was tricked by the old  lady who transformed into momo and how  kaido won because of that unfair  advantage he had the lady killed that's  how upset he was and it probably even  contributed to his drinking more i'd say  his lack of honor in that situation  really haunted him because he went on to  execute odin instead of giving him  another shot and now with all the  emotionally amplified effects of alcohol  it looks like it just happened all over  again will he try to write his wrongs  from the past here will he go after a cp  0 agent which seems like the obvious  move after he went after the lady last  time will he let luffy go because of the  interference in direct contrast to how  he executed odin or and this is my hope  will luffy bounce back stronger than  ever with a new gear or awakened form  although i hope it's not the case this  fight could potentially be over here  since luffy said he was at his limit and  he just got hit point blank by kaido's  attack if it is over i don't think kaido  would finish him off since he definitely  feel bad for the interference this whole  arc has been preparing us for this  moment but at the same time i feel like  this has to be settled here since we  can't have luffy face kaido again  sometime down the line after all this  build up and after all these chapters  let me know your thoughts here all i  know is that i'm very excited for the  next chapter in fact i can't remember  the last time i was more excited than  this for the next chapter that is it for  this one obviously mvp goes to luffy for  me but if kaido beats the cp-0 agent  next chapter and lets luffy recover then  next chapter mvp is going to kaido since  that will show a lot of growth in the  dude's character after all that time  spent denying honor if you did enjoy  this review and want to keep them coming  you know what to do channel power king  within and smash that like button with  no mercy always remember smashing is  pirating energy and passing is scared of  rochi energy so choose wisely if you  haven't make this the video subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all notifications or you will miss  future one-piece videos and updates and  while you wait for the next chapter to  drop feel free to check out my huge and  growing one-piece playlist that includes  videos not the yonko admirals supernova  and much more link to that is in the  description and until next time see ya  space cowboys

